---
title: "trie_set (Osaka Fork: State Trie (Merkle Patricia Trie))"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_default: value == trie.default
    [*] --> q_set: value != trie.default
    q_check_default --> q_check_exists: key in trie._data
    q_check_default --> q_done_noop: key not in trie._data
    q_check_exists --> q_delete: del trie._data[key]
    q_delete --> [*]
    q_done_noop --> [*]
    q_set --> q_assign: trie._data[key] = value
    q_assign --> [*]
    note right of q_assign
        INV-006: Default values are represented by absence from trie._data
        INV-007: Setting a key to the default value deletes it from _data
    end note
